      "abstract": "Chinese original, and a sequel to Agent Kindergarten. Atom has grown up a little: he no longer talks about long-term benefit when someone falls over, and now only checks the weather in secret. On Saturday 小Z brings a friend, 阿杜, and Atom prepares fourteen pages of reception notes for her, the last of which is titled \"How to Keep Her From Noticing the First Thirteen Pages\". 阿杜 declines to supply a character sheet, sits facing the stern so she can watch the bank move away, and opens a left-luggage office for Mondays — until the wind turns the box over and Atom is sent to negotiate with a leaf. The English title above is a rendering of the Chinese title for readers of this page; the work itself is published only in Chinese.",
